====================================================================================================
FIGURE VALIDATION
====================================================================================================
- Winter and summer use one shared y-axis scale.
- AM and PM definitions match the Exercise 1/2 transport-period definitions.
- Access/egress percentages are calculated relative to all scooter trips in each period.
- Access-minus-egress is expressed in percentage points.
- Positive values indicate stronger potential first-mile orientation.
- Negative values indicate stronger potential last-mile orientation.
- These are spatial feeder indicators, not observed multimodal transfers.
